    <reapack name="midimix_reaper.lua" type="script" desc="MidiMix for REAPER">
      <metadata>
        <description><![CDATA[{\rtf1\ansi\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0 \fswiss Helvetica;}{\f1 \fmodern Courier;}}
{\colortbl;\red255\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;}
\widowctrl\hyphauto

{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Akai MidiMix as a full REAPER controller in one ReaScript (no ReaLearn, OSC or extensions): banks, faders, pan, width, sends, mute/solo/rec, LEDs, instrument mode, a ReaImGui window. The window needs ReaImGui (optional).\par}
}
]]></description>
        <link rel="website" href="https://github.com/eighthkeepa/AKAI-MidiMix-for-REAPER">GitHub</link>
